Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.64,0:00:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.72,0:00:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone okay? Hideous. Tied up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you have to yank us\Nback with your creepy jeans?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.08,0:00:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.99,0:00:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assumed that you wanted to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.58,0:00:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're tougher than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.24,0:00:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough playing defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.64,0:00:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our best bet is to attack all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.26,0:00:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's start throwing fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.10,0:00:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My blade is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agreed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.57,0:00:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you're hungry for some arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.88,0:00:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, boring strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.58,0:00:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll find it impossible to\Ndestroy my barrier of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:00:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not for the protagonist! What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.24,0:01:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,History.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's technically the world's oldest vending\Nmachine from way back in the B.C.'s.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.88,0:01:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold, the Egyptian holy water dispenser!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowledge is power!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.10,0:01:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That substance dissolved my barrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.94,0:01:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, that worked better than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.32,0:01:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Score one for the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.78,0:01:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah-ka-ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.26,0:01:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.17,0:01:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their own shadows, I betrayed them. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.06,0:01:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dang, that's a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.90,0:01:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But maybe I can free Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That did the trick! It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.32,0:01:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was chasing a hunch my\Nbarrier would free her. Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.12,0:01:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you would be the last thorn\Nin my side, magic item. Nay, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.80,0:01:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's my next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.98,0:01:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too risky to go and free the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.58,0:01:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stage has finally been set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trust you know what I'm getting at.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanna fight one-on-one?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.72,0:02:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voxo and the Dalvik Knight, let us\Nsettle this battle once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.58,0:02:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can do this. Together!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.03,0:02:18.45,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(357,434)\fscx100\fsp6\pos(412,55}Dreamworld
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.34,0:02:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.88,0:02:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open wide, jaws of soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.52,0:02:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Infernal water.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got guarded? Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mopko, drop the barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.84,0:02:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave this jerk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.56,0:02:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:03:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your vain efforts are most entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.32,0:03:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a battle just to get in range.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.15,0:03:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth is, I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.62,0:03:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A certain function caught my eye\Nwhen I first got to this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.82,0:03:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I wasn't ready to use it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.24,0:03:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's finally time to give it a whirl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.74,0:03:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The function I speak of is\Npretty pricey, but let's splurge.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.92,0:03:18.96,sign_Arial,text (top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&HFAF1F2&\3c&H401A12&\shad0\bord4}Investigate\NSleep\NConserve Power\NInspect\NGoods\NInventory\NStatus\NFunctions\NAbilities\NBlessings\NTransform
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.96,0:03:19.92,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H46221B&\3c&HF8F0F4&\shad0\bord4\fs40}Transform
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.44,0:03:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It costs a billion points!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Transform ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.90,0:03:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thing I'm loaded thanks to the\NSacred Tree Dungeon Master's treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.34,0:03:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.74,0:03:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.82,0:03:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could mere water cut\Nthrough my evil staff?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.42,0:03:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was really cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.62,0:03:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing fancy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.26,0:03:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just cranked up a power washer's\Npressure and fully constricted the nozzle,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:04:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,essentially turning into\Nmy own water jet cutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing could even slice\Nthrough steel and diamond!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.76,0:04:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.76,0:04:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's water and you haven't\Neven changed your form!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ain't seen nothing yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.44,0:04:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, you'll keep neutralizing\Nmy impregnable barrier! Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Transform's first ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.12,0:04:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just spoke like a normal person!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.26,0:04:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprise bonus that while\NTransform is active,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.96,0:04:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can gab away by combining\Nall my speech functions! Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.22,0:04:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's not why I\Nrope the bank on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.36,0:04:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for Transform's real first ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it lets me combine my\Nvarious bending functions!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.30,0:04:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's more, I can swap out the\Ncontents of any of my goods!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.78,0:04:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Epic!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.74,0:05:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can add a power washer and a gasoline\Nnozzle to my tried-and-true base form.
