Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, the big bad thinks he's hot stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smolens! Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.96,0:05:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jump up, as high as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.74,0:05:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you want me to jump real high?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.96,0:05:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.34,0:05:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being able to really\Ntalk to you is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.48,0:05:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.36,0:05:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next up, form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.14,0:05:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Used vehicle vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.78,0:05:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Activating barrier and\Ntrampling them with drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Checkmate, certified\Npre-owned barrage. Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.32,0:05:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, they're loaded with holy water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.62,0:06:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for not taking you seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.64,0:06:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conserving my power against you was a\Nfoolish error that I will now correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, are you as scared as me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.14,0:06:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm scared stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.56,0:06:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, we'll win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just believe in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.38,0:06:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.06,0:06:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silly me. It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I always have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.84,0:06:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.74,0:07:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll crush those brave spirits of yours\Nand relish every last moment of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.30,0:07:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.60,0:07:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You deployed several barriers to increase\Nthe overall strength just as I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.96,0:07:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darn Skippy, I stole your idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.86,0:07:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's still not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, keep your eye on the\Nenemy. Stay strong. Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welp, let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.16,0:07:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Netherlord, don't blink or you'll miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.88,0:07:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Transform's second power!
