Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.46,0:08:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would rely on illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In your final hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.62,0:08:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your desperate struggles were in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.14,0:08:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finally rid of that magic\Nbox! Now I can. Too bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, it's not over yet! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.28,0:09:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Team Voxo's going strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The illusions have barriers?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.10,0:09:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, they're the real deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all Boxxo, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.44,0:09:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yup, that's Transform's second ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can transform goods into clones of\Nmyself with the exact same powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meaning,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.29,0:09:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my consciousness resides in\Neach of these vending machines,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.18,0:09:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'm them and they're me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.70,0:09:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shout-out to the Ice\NVending Machine's comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.31,0:09:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping Transform would let me change
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.26,0:09:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into a giant robot or\Nsomething equally teak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.44,0:09:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feels like it should have been\Ncalled Clone or Copy or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.46,0:09:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but as a vending machine\Nsuperfan, I am not mad about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.80,0:09:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Netherlord, hope you're ready to\Nface off against a brigade of Voxos!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.39,0:09:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening! Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.82,0:09:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a whole lot of Voxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't forget, there's a timer on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.42,0:09:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That pesky 30-minute limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's another catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.90,0:10:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When time runs out, I can't turn into\Nother vending machines for a full day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.88,0:10:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta know, what do you call\Nthis strategy? Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall call it Vending\NMachine Corner Dream World.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.48,0:10:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has a nice ring to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.14,0:10:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a dream world for\Nvending machine enthusiasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A happy little corner of the world packed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.48,0:10:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with tons of beauteous\Nmechanical aspirations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy this fantasy to the fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.24,0:10:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.14,0:10:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Numbers 4 through 20, give him the\Nold cardboard and balloon combo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest of me, prepare to fire\Nusing power washer nozzles!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.86,0:10:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, we gotta do it up right\Nfor the final boss battle, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.54,0:10:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Numbers 21 through 24, time\Nto transform into jukeboxes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with the muses?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't have a final boss\Nbattle without a sick BGM.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.54,0:11:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,B-G-M?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.04,0:11:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you're thirsty, big boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.70,0:11:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not give in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.70,0:11:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll gain power, overthrow the\NDemon Lord, and reclaim my throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.94,0:11:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like copium, the mad\Nprops for your determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anywho, try this on for size.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.24,0:11:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Triple nozzles all around!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.82,0:11:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shooting quadroplets of holy water!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you like me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest in pieces, nether dork!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's one tough cookie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.42,0:11:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oxo, you wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.62,0:11:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What sort of fiend from hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.20,0:11:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a vending machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.78,0:11:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tag in, aerial squad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Number seven's first in line!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.42,0:11:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta love leading with luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.52,0:12:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Install concrete slabs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.94,0:12:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat concrete!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.04,0:12:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Block those 10, 12, and 17!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that order, form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you could do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.92,0:12:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Voxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.26,0:12:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't plan the parade just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.78,0:12:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could see defeat, Hulemy,\Nbut one day you will be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, leave until your butt's fully kicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.26,0:12:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Lamas! Hop on up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hoppin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.74,0:12:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.48,0:12:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.02,0:12:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.50,0:13:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were this close to winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.10,0:13:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cracky timing for Transform to run out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.70,0:13:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.61,0:13:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've still got ten seconds left!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These fizzy bottles are filled with gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check out my cola thrusters!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do your thing, Lammis!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.38,0:13:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah! Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.70,0:13:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's over? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.48,0:13:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.96,0:13:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're back to being\Nthe strong silent type.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.06,0:13:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more second and our\Ngoose would have been cooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:13:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lammis! Mr. Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.28,0:14:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you really did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.78,0:14:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not hurt, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.12,0:14:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can still produce food?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.62,0:14:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.53,0:14:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.84,0:14:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to lend\Nyou my sword in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.50,0:14:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was fun to see him squirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.04,0:14:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was an ocean of boxos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.20,0:14:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neat trick, although I wish we'd been\Nclose enough to get a better look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.14,0:14:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain's family missed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish everyone could have seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every director and all\Nof our friends back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of home, the\Nmagic portal is busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.34,0:14:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing the Netherlord\Nburned through too much mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.18,0:14:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean we're stuck\Nhere for a while longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, won't we starve to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.02,0:14:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may have used a boatload\Nof points on Transform,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.64,0:14:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I still have plenty of snacks left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could comfortably feed\Nthose six for several years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't worry about things\Nlike that with Boxo around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.96,0:14:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.87,0:14:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know Boxo will always have our backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.50,0:14:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.68,0:14:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I love how he\Nkeeps us from starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.98,0:14:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.14,0:14:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo is the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Boxo, I'll follow you till I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.64,0:15:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.38,0:15:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know we'll always be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.10,0:15:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be the one who's\Nsaying that, silly Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.46,0:15:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Master, tread carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.11,0:15:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems I scared you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I am the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm the one and only\Ndemon lord, the Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.66,0:15:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.18,0:15:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's in the letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must mean the one you\Ngot from that field guy.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.32,0:15:35.07,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H462F25&\3c&HBFC1D6&\shad0\bord4}A vending machine? That's a neat reincarnation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.26,0:15:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm certain you've heard of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.76,0:15:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, the rumors are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.38,0:15:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a sentient vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.76,0:15:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Takes me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.12,0:15:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you know what a vending machine is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.74,0:15:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we have more in\Ncommon than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.50,0:15:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's real fascinating,\Nbut what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avenging the butt-kicking\Nof your former ally?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.39,0:15:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came to collect you\Nand take you back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.50,0:16:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my understanding that your\Nmagical portal isn't functioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.84,0:16:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I'm not welcome here...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.10,0:16:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need the help. Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.16,0:16:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An evil god rules over this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll spare the details\Nwhile we are still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.94,0:16:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pleased to see\Nyou're all in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.76,0:16:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent work, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.78,0:16:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd pull it off, Kerioyl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.14,0:16:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After everything that Netherlord\Nput my family through,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be the one to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm still grateful. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.98,0:16:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can put this\Nawful chapter behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.26,0:16:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Valiant fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.26,0:16:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They appreciate everything you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My whole family shares the sentiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.12,0:16:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it's finally finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.62,0:16:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.38,0:16:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.29,0:16:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.36,0:16:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saving the world's a total rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.24,0:16:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just mad it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.62,0:16:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can pour our little hearts\Ninto rebuilding from rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.84,0:16:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although the past is filled with\Nsorrow, we can build a better tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.80,0:17:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.64,0:17:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need a little break.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I imagine you're exhausted\Nafter all of that commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting enough rest is\Npart of a hunter's job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.54,0:17:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard work demands leisure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.56,0:17:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui, we were worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.88,0:17:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work out there. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was pretty fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of us from the whole\NClearflow Lake Stratum
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.66,0:17:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are supremely proud of\Nour mightiest hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.80,0:17:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure that those of us who didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.12,0:17:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,live to see this day are\Nsmiling down upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.68,0:17:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howdy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.59,0:17:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's it hanging?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.66,0:17:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We lead some strange lives\Nfor two Japanese dudes, Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.88,0:17:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.14,0:17:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you talking smack about my mom?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.21,0:17:57.59,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H0C2565&\3c&H1B55B1&\shad0}When did you get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.44,0:17:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kidding, but no idea what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.16,0:18:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's wicked clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.48,0:18:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't had a chat in Japanese in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did I get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.88,0:18:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A few miles ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was with our displaced pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.40,0:18:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we'll rebuild where the old\Ndungeon used to be, brick by brick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow we're already at the\Nfortified city in just two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.98,0:18:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nice to see\Nyou, Boxxo. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We heard the good news about\Nyou defeating the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.74,0:18:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't expect anything less.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.78,0:18:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm back in business,\Nbe sure to pay us a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you a good time on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.60,0:18:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come there aren't any smooth,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.18,0:18:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sexy ladies handing out good\Ntimes in my neck of the woods?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.36,0:18:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm jealous as hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.48,0:18:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.93,0:18:45.68,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H0A2243&\3c&H1A80CF&\shad0}Holy hell am I jealous! What do you plan to do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.54,0:18:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what's next on the docket?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dungeon exploration.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.10,0:18:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing you mean the ones that\Ndole out a wish for clearing them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.84,0:18:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a chance I could\Ngo human again too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.78,0:18:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Assuming I even fit in a dungeon!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.94,0:18:56.69,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H0C2357&\3c&H174691&\shad0}Would my body fit inside a dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:18:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I find one you can fit\Nin, I'll let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.22,0:19:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet another reason to go out\Nand wonder some dungeons!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.20,0:19:10.08,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H0C2357&\3c&H174691&\shad0}Make it so, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're ever both human, I hope we\Ncan make the time to share a nice meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.22,0:19:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.13,0:19:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be stoked if that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.14,0:19:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, no complaints\Nabout my agrarian life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.36,0:19:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.80,0:19:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Life as a vending\Nmachine isn't too shabby.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.59,0:19:22.22,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H00132C&\3c&H174691&\shad0}Sure, hopefully there's a future like that.\N Not that I have any complaints about my agrarian lifestyle.\N Same goes for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.20,0:19:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you two find a way to chat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to interrupt,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.16,0:19:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's something I'd like\Nto discuss with Field in private.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.38,0:19:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What sort of thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.76,0:19:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember that nasty\Nlittle comment you made
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when you saw Miss Shirley and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.12,0:19:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nacho!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.03,0:19:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.15,0:19:43.07,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an9\b1\fs15\shad0\3c&H3F3F3F&\bord1.5}Translation:\N{\fs18.5}Duane Johnson\N{\fs15}Timing:\N{\fs18.5}Edgar Cruz
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.86,0:19:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The story's really over? Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.32,0:19:48.24,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an9\b1\fs15\shad0\3c&H3F3F3F&\bord1.5}Editing:\N{\fs18.5}Alicia Ashby\N{\fs15}Quality Control:\N{\fs18.5}Salem Alabanza
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.34,0:19:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxxo, mind if I tag along, you\Nknow, to the other dungeons? Hello there.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.49,0:19:52.42,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an9\b1\fs15\shad0\3c&H3F3F3F&\bord1.5}Final Quality Control:\N{\fs18.5}Michelle Tymon
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.92,0:19:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You promise that's what you really want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.24,0:19:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.66,0:19:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't be happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.90,0:19:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do so many amazing things now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.84,0:20:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was worried maybe you didn't\Nneed me lugging you around anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.38,0:20:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.60,0:20:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know you're my best girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.40,0:20:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're like two halves of a sandwich!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.44,0:20:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've always been together,\Nand we always will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who should be thanking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.70,0:20:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow! I kissed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.98,0:20:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, um, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something I've been meaning\Nto tell you for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.14,0:20:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but just say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.76,0:20:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've fallen in love. Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.44,0:20:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, bad timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.08,0:20:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That didn't go the way\NI imagined it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.18,0:20:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.48,0:20:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, figs for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's to our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.60,0:20:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.84,0:21:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you too, Foxo, with my whole heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.22,0:21:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers to victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.70,0:21:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.32,0:21:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all worked so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.06,0:21:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat as much as you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's welcome to\Njoin the festivities!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.92,0:21:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This award is such an inspiration!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.88,0:21:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're embarrassing me, big sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.18,0:21:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both and wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.60,0:21:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's our tiny bro a\Ncertified lady killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.26,0:21:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That tears it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.17,0:21:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go hunting for girlfriends!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My poor boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.44,0:21:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look scrumptious,\Ntruly. Are you drunk, Lammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.04,0:21:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You changed our lives, Foxhole.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.56,0:21:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure look pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.66,0:21:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tonight's been just perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.18,0:21:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we hung in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a heck of a party?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.84,0:21:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.06,0:22:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I was reborn as a vending machine\Nin another world. Not gonna lie,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.80,0:22:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's a pretty ridiculous premise?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.98,0:22:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, I'm surrounded\Nby people I care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.34,0:22:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.54,0:22:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm living my best life!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.46,0:22:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying a magic box saved the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of a vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.42,0:22:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I speak the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.74,0:22:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only could he dish out food and drinks,\Nbut all sorts of everyday items, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.20,0:22:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A refrigerated dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.38,0:22:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A metal box with internal dialogue\Nthat could change its shape?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.72,0:22:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, Pops, I bet you're just\Nlying to us because we're kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.36,0:22:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.50,0:22:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking you should\Ncall me Pal instead of Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.56,0:22:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, a little treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.42,0:22:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.64,0:22:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never had anything so tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.36,0:22:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes my tummy happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.08,0:22:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad. Pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.86,0:22:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, Pal? Question.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.86,0:22:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did these come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.96,0:22:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just say I'm good at conjuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.66,0:22:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conjuring?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.57,0:22:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sort of like magic. It's magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.62,0:22:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you knew magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.20,0:22:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.66,0:22:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.36,0:23:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I found ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.10,0:23:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to go explore the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.18,0:23:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gang's all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.36,0:23:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow I'm still not used to that sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.48,0:23:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I think he's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.02,0:23:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's truly a man among men.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.82,0:23:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm way too hungry to conquer a dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.12,0:23:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could use a fresh pair of boots, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.60,0:23:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.51,0:23:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends and I are off to the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.50,0:23:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll show you one\Nlast trick before we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.82,0:23:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.94,0:23:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you get your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.74,0:23:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll keep wandering this\Ndungeon until you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.06,0:23:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if you're ready, then\Njust say the magic words.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.18,0:23:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:36.26,0:23:40.00,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon

